nd "Jinx on The Divide" (2006). The first novel was originally published by the small press publisher Chicken House (now a division of Scholastic), with subsequent volumes published by Scholastic, which also reprinted the first novel. The books have been translated into French, German, Spanish, Finnish, Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese, Italian, Romanian and Dutch.', 'node_id': '1dda7a08-c0f6-40d7-83c8-79bd305a07f4', 'score': -5.4445567}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.405645214021206, 'vram_usage': 13.4296875}
