low ratings. It was supposed to begin in 2003 but was delayed. It was produced by David Kohan, Max Mutchnick and Jenji Kohan.', 'node_id': '9c093604-1ea4-4c43-b6e2-305505ba8247', 'score': 1.1191385984420776}, {'text': 'The Broadway production however was short-lived, closing in September 2009. A national tour of the US launched in 2010, followed by a UK premiere in 2012 and returns to the UK in 2017 in a new production at The Gatehouse in London with a West End cast, as part of a fringe festival.', 'node_id': '7722c090-45f6-4a59-9d9c-6ab96b8e84b7', 'score': 1.1215977668762207}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.653252050280571, 'vram_usage': 1.24755859375}
