gles, album and live tracks from their previous albums, together with a cover version of Nancy Sinatra\'s "These Boots Are Made for Walkin\'" that was originally recorded for the multi-artist album "When Pigs Fly: Songs You Thought You\'d Never Hear". The eight page booklet contains an essay by Josh Norek.', 'node_id': 'ed62126a-d1ec-410e-ab56-679467439fd8', 'score': 0.9352837800979614}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8664845544844866, 'vram_usage': 1.24755859375}
