icated. At milepost 000/0BA/00J187 the 98 track merges into the 12 track, making for 3 tracks now. There is a crossover from 99 to 12, also a crossover from 12 to 3. About 2/10ths of a mile down the 99 merges into the 12 track reducing the tracks back to the regular double.', 'node_id': 'd502f0f9-7c0d-4557-9126-d2002b1605fc', 'score': 1.0277683734893799}, {'text': 'In 1996, the race was shortened to its current distance of 400 miles; the 400 mile race was called the Goodwrench Service 400 (1996–1997), the GM Goodwrench Service Plus 400 (1998), the Dura Lube/Big K 400 (1999), the Dura Lube/Kmart 400 (2000), the Dura Lube 400 (2001), and the Subway 400 (2002–2004).', 'node_id': 'c3867592-0e54-4fac-8f7b-0227f8b299f7', 'score': 1.0594336986541748}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.6632359586656094, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
