iver from Kansas City, Missouri, it is now almost completely surrounded by Kansas City, which has annexed far to the north of North Kansas City's northern city limits. North Kansas City also adjoins the small municipality of Avondale.", 'node_id': '141d3e47-3f06-4979-8b31-d54b2a0ec953', 'score': 1.2339433431625366}, {'text': 'At the 2015 census , Tenterfield had a population of 6,986.', 'node_id': '72d3d748-0413-416a-b74d-ff761e04730b', 'score': 1.2344880104064941}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.6662754192948341, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
