duced in France.', 'node_id': '6bd77c3e-914b-4713-a904-2eb71302fb2b', 'score': 1.142040729522705}, {'text': "This is a list of soft drinks in order of the brand's country of origin. A soft drink is a beverage that typically contains water (often, but not always, carbonated water), usually a sweetener and usually a flavoring agent. The sweetener may be sugar, high-fructose corn syrup, fruit juice, sugar substitutes (in the case of diet drinks) or some combination of these. Soft drinks may also contain caffeine, colorings, preservatives and other ingredients.", 'node_id': '8bef20b8-7cc7-4040-a993-daa9388c5947', 'score': 1.1516345739364624}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8562928307801485, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
