ic Coast Conference, finishing in last and failing to a win a conference game.', 'node_id': '8ecdfed6-526d-4921-8bde-a02bf76bb4ed', 'score': 5.519324}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.7827840335667133, 'vram_usage': 12.27197265625}
