ght Test Group, stationed at Edwards Air Force Base, California.', 'node_id': '6ae90f28-14ec-41b1-a174-16d9e2dbbf8b', 'score': 0.6065903306007385}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.6410419456660748, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
