['B-17 Flying Fortress bomber'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding which airplane Major test-flying after whom the base, that the 514th Flight Test Squadron is stationed at, is named.', 'query': 'Which airplane was this Major test-flying after whom the base, that 514th Flight Test Squadron is stated at, is named?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The 514th Flight Test Squadron (514 FLTS) is a United States Air Force squadron. It is assigned to the Ogden Air Logistics Center (OO-ALC), Air Force Materiel Command, stationed at Hill Air Force Base, Utah.', 'node_id': 'a46ea0f8-2201-4cc5-bf39-f835ffa37b67', 'score': 16.652957916259766}, {'text': 'The 417th Flight Test Squadron is an inactive United States Air Force squadron. It was last assigned to the 412th Operations Group at Edwards Air Force Base, California, where it was inactivated on 14 February 2012. The squadron was first activated in 1989 as the 6517th Test Squadron and conducted flight testing of the McDonnell Douglas C-17 Globemaster III until it was inactivated in 1995 as the 417th Test Squadron. It was reactivated in 2006 and performed ground and flight testing on the Boeing YAL-1A until 2012.', 'node_id': 'd6c7bcd2-f02c-4613-ba97-db4fb006ffc0', 'score': 15.697590827941895}, {'text': 'The 370th Flight Test Squadron is a United States Air Force unit assigned to the 413th Flight Test Group, stationed at Edwards Air Force Base, California.', 'node_id': '6ae90f28-14ec-41b1-a174-16d9e2dbbf8b', 'score': 15.539046287536621}, {'text': 'The 415th Flight Test Flight is a United States Air Force reserve squadron. It is assigned to the 413th Flight Test Group of Air Force Reserve Command, stationed at Randolph Field, Joint Base San Antonio, Texas.', 'node_id': '2e5a14ab-9220-43bd-bbab-e71201906ff5', 'score': 14.90380859375}, {'text': 'The 339th Flight Test Squadron is a United States Air Force unit based at Robins Air Force Base, Georgia. It is part of the Warner Robins Air Logistics Center, with a mission to certify aircraft as worthy to return to service. The squadron is responsible for conducting flight tests on the Lockheed C-130 Hercules, the Lockheed C-5 Galaxy and McDonnell Douglas F-15 Eagle after program depot maintenance is completed.', 'node_id': '49bf1269-abab-447a-b1f5-6531a2c6256b', 'score': 14.431071281433105}, {'text': 'The 413th Flight Test Squadron is part of the 96th Test Wing and is based at Duke Field, Eglin Air Force Base, Florida. It performs flight testing on C-130 Hercules, CV-22 Osprey, MH-53 Pave Low, UH-1 Iroquois, and HH-60 Pave Hawk aircraft.', 'node_id': '82c8cf82-58c4-4f5f-81ba-d8170a97d1ca', 'score': 13.816450119018555}, {'text': 'The 10th Flight Test Squadron is part of the 413th Flight Test Group of Air Force Materiel Command based at Tinker Air Force Base, Oklahoma. It performs acceptance testing on refurbished Rockwell B-1 Lancer, Boeing B-52 Stratofortress, Boeing E-3 Sentry, and Boeing KC-135 Stratotanker aircraft before they are returned to their units.', 'node_id': 'a4ece69a-471b-421c-afad-d13aa44d0167', 'score': 13.503018379211426}, {'text': 'The 419th Flight Test Squadron is a United States Air Force squadron. It is assigned to the 412th Operations Group, Air Force Materiel Command, stationed at Edwards Air Force Base, California.', 'node_id': 'a91059f0-741e-4e42-8e76-894eb166af8b', 'score': 13.417936325073242}, {'text': 'The 445th Flight Test Squadron (445 FTS) is a United States Air Force squadron. It was last assigned to the 412th Operations Group, Air Force Materiel Command, stationed at Edwards Air Force Base, California.', 'node_id': '1e9684b2-1f16-4080-8cd2-3736e2cf096b', 'score': 12.940783500671387}, {'text': 'The 486th Flight Test Squadron is a secretive unit, with a somewhat misleading designation, assigned to Eglin Air Force Base, Florida, and which is associated with United States Department of State Foreign Emergency Support Team activities. The squadron motto is ""Non semper ea sunt quae videntur"" which translates as "Not always what they seem".', 'node_id': '33aca1a1-c648-4d57-a8d4-afd31a2f6404', 'score': 12.720929145812988}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.7090426869690418, 'vram_usage': 0.0}
