ive Henry Gordon McMorran (1844–1929).', 'node_id': 'a849e83e-f132-4ba4-91ea-752b52e2a467', 'score': 1.2019851207733154}, {'text': 'Captain Henry Hall was an American from Dennis, Massachusetts who fought in the American Revolutionary War, who later was the first to successfully cultivate cranberries.', 'node_id': 'd2996f24-c57b-4625-93ab-f6fda27088c4', 'score': 1.2550264596939087}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.8518734145909548, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
