adaptation by Big Huge Games. The download was released in Japan on December 18, 2008 for 1200 yen. The game has since expanded to other territories.', 'node_id': '119af9ed-e57b-4273-9b5f-85439a970590', 'score': 0.93329918384552}, {'text': 'The Kids of Catan is a German board game designed for children using the theme from "The Settlers of Catan". Like other Catan titles, the game is created by Klaus Teuber and published by Kosmos in German and Mayfair Games in English.', 'node_id': 'd2e4198b-ee71-4265-987e-82a369c74324', 'score': 0.9625885486602783}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.7169849425554276, 'vram_usage': 1.21240234375}
