rary) and Toronto-based Cuppa Coffee Studios, the one-hour special premiered on ABC Family on Saturday, December 13, 2008, during the network\'s annual The 25 Days of Christmas programming.', 'node_id': '6568ce5f-7f98-447c-8caf-616899a5dc78', 'score': 0.8901466131210327}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.5849336292594671, 'vram_usage': 1.24755859375}
