st performed country songs of the year.', 'node_id': 'bfede151-d1b5-4682-9694-76211d0be07a', 'score': 0.9293434619903564}, {'text': '"Chattahoochee" is a song co-written and recorded by American country music artist Alan Jackson. It was released in May 1993 as the third single from his album "A Lot About Livin\' (And a Little \'bout Love)". The album is named for a line in the song itself. Jackson wrote the song with Jim McBride.', 'node_id': '10c98798-ba8a-4178-b21a-81539d0672d5', 'score': 0.9491137266159058}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9119437970221043, 'vram_usage': 1.42333984375}
