 31%|███       | 154/500 [25:11<57:59, 10.06s/it]  ['yes'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding Laeliocattleya. However, it does confirm that Broughtonia is a genus of orchids, specifically a member of the Orchidaceae family. Therefore, while I cannot provide information about Laeliocattleya, I can confirm that Broughtonia is indeed an orchid.', 'query': 'Are Broughtonia and Laeliocattleya both orchids?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Broughtonia is a genus of orchids (family Orchidaceae) native to the Bahamas and the Greater Antilles. The genus is abbreviated Bro in trade journals.', 'node_id': 'd23f1118-5a5e-45fd-b5d6-beda7441a284', 'score': 0.6015279293060303}, {'text': 'Some of the many orchids described and named by Nicholls and retaining the name he gave them include "Caladenia caudata", "Caladenia echidnachila", "Caladenia ensata", "Caladenia ferruginea", "Caladenia magniclavata", "Caladenia ornata", "Caladenia praecox", "Caladenia radiata", "Pterostylis fischii", "Pterostylis hamiltonii", "Pterostylis hildii" and "Pterostylis tenuissima".', 'node_id': '30ad6dbc-2058-4b1e-9720-1d81f0204859', 'score': 0.6382994055747986}, {'text': 'Broughtonia sanguinea, also known as Blood Red Broughtonia is a plant in the genus "Broughtonia", a member of the Orchidaceae family. The genus is abbreviated Bro in trade journals.', 'node_id': '428acb24-4f5d-4633-bff0-c114813adf18', 'score': 0.6648596525192261}, {'text': 'Caladenia, commonly known as spider orchids, is a genus of 350 species of plants in the orchid family, Orchidaceae. Spider orchids are terrestrial herbs with a single hairy leaf and a hairy stem. The labellum is fringed or toothed in most species and there are small projections called calli on the labellum. The flowers have adaptations to attract particular species of insects for pollination.', 'node_id': '488606fa-d902-466c-8019-462bda217773', 'score': 0.8025929927825928}, {'text': 'Duck orchids have a single leaf and one or a few, dull-coloured, inconspicuous flowers.', 'node_id': '05b95ddc-e0c1-4a2e-b1a5-5941f2e72805', 'score': 0.8933048248291016}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.1096869017928839, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
