ool of Veterinary Medicine. Dr. McCowan is also affiliated with the Alaska Whale Foundation, SETI Institute, Hubbs-Sea World Institute, and Santa Fe Institute.', 'node_id': '9f2d0894-aeda-4b36-8c25-ae5e5c2adb55', 'score': -6.411422}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.3134033549576998, 'vram_usage': 13.23486328125}
