es 500 years later by Owen Shahadah and Nubian Spirit by Louis Buckley which highlight her knowledge of Nile Valley Civilisations. She is also resident poet and MC for Poetry in Session the longest running poetry event in Kampala to date.', 'node_id': 'd16a5d02-dfc3-46c4-851c-0c888fef95d9', 'score': 1.2136695384979248}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.7876948677003384, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
