retoria's Public Works Department, before becoming borough surveyor in Lusaka, Zambia, in 1926, where he died in 1938.", 'node_id': '86f7adbd-6aad-43c1-b0f1-7587179348b2', 'score': 1.3062740564346313}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.6624652482569218, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
