irst year, it was one of Malaysia's most watched TV programmes with audiences of over 3 million.", 'node_id': '8cc568bd-745a-4095-8eec-0532b9fd171c', 'score': 1.138991355895996}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.6265489216893911, 'vram_usage': 1.21240234375}
