 42%|████▏     | 209/500 [34:21<56:43, 11.70s/it]['Gal Gadot'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding which post DC Extended Universe actress will also play a role in what is intended to be the fifth installment of the DC Extended Universe.', 'query': 'Which post DC Extended Universe actress will also play a role in what is intended to be the fifth installment of the DC Extended Universe?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The DC Extended Universe is a media franchise and shared fictional universe that is the setting of superhero films independently produced by Warner Bros., based on characters that appear in DC Comics publications.', 'node_id': '9318ec15-4634-488f-bedf-c2c62e90c214', 'score': 0.7982370257377625}, {'text': 'Many DC characters make cameo appearances and are referenced in the background. The original principal voice cast returns to reprise their respective roles.', 'node_id': '84dbd09c-8f8b-42c2-aa20-93f6c06561bd', 'score': 0.8421881198883057}, {'text': 'The Justice League Universe (JLUDCEUUJLDCE), more commonly known by its unofficial name as the DC Extended Universe (DCEU), is an American media franchise and shared universe, centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros. Pictures, based on characters that appear in publications by DC Comics. The shared universe, much like the original DC Universe in comic books, was established by crossing over common plot elements, settings, cast, and characters. The films have been in production since 2011 and in that time Warner Bros.', 'node_id': '52c5e570-6a3f-4105-be48-254a3366371a', 'score': 1.0018775463104248}, {'text': 'She was Freya Beauchamp on the Lifetime series "Witches of East End" and as of 2016 was playing the recurring role of Lucy Lane in "Supergirl".', 'node_id': '209d75bc-7044-4f8f-83c5-d02dee1b7ae6', 'score': 1.0635404586791992}, {'text': 'Wonder Woman is a 2017 American superhero film based on the DC Comics character of the same name, distributed by Warner Bros. Pictures. It is the fourth installment in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU). The film is directed by Patty Jenkins, with a screenplay by Allan Heinberg, from a story by Heinberg, Zack Snyder, and Jason Fuchs, and stars Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, David Thewlis, Connie Nielsen, and Elena Anaya.', 'node_id': '4c727023-47a5-4167-b2a4-7405e5bc8ac8', 'score': 1.1327972412109375}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9306038599461317, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
