['Gal Gadot'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding which post DC Extended Universe actress will also play a role in what is intended to be the fifth installment of the DC Extended Universe.', 'query': 'Which post DC Extended Universe actress will also play a role in what is intended to be the fifth installment of the DC Extended Universe?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The DC Extended Universe is a media franchise and shared fictional universe that is the setting of superhero films independently produced by Warner Bros., based on characters that appear in DC Comics publications.', 'node_id': '9318ec15-4634-488f-bedf-c2c62e90c214', 'score': 0.7982370257377625}, {'text': 'Many DC characters make cameo appearances and are referenced in the background. The original principal voice cast returns to reprise their respective roles.', 'node_id': '84dbd09c-8f8b-42c2-aa20-93f6c06561bd', 'score': 0.8421881198883057}, {'text': 'The Justice League Universe (JLUDCEUUJLDCE), more commonly known by its unofficial name as the DC Extended Universe (DCEU), is an American media franchise and shared universe, centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros. Pictures, based on characters that appear in publications by DC Comics. The shared universe, much like the original DC Universe in comic books, was established by crossing over common plot elements, settings, cast, and characters. The films have been in production since 2011 and in that time Warner Bros.', 'node_id': '52c5e570-6a3f-4105-be48-254a3366371a', 'score': 1.0018775463104248}, {'text': 'She was Freya Beauchamp on the Lifetime series "Witches of East End" and as of 2016 was playing the recurring role of Lucy Lane in "Supergirl".', 'node_id': '209d75bc-7044-4f8f-83c5-d02dee1b7ae6', 'score': 1.0635404586791992}, {'text': 'Wonder Woman is a 2017 American superhero film based on the DC Comics character of the same name, distributed by Warner Bros. Pictures. It is the fourth installment in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU). The film is directed by Patty Jenkins, with a screenplay by Allan Heinberg, from a story by Heinberg, Zack Snyder, and Jason Fuchs, and stars Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, David Thewlis, Connie Nielsen, and Elena Anaya.', 'node_id': '4c727023-47a5-4167-b2a4-7405e5bc8ac8', 'score': 1.1327972412109375}, {'text': 'Lucy Elizabeth Fry (born 13 March 1992) is an Australian actress. She is known for portraying Zoey in "Lightning Point", Lyla in "", and Vasilisa Dragomir in the film "Vampire Academy". Fry was also cast in Hulu\'s eight part miniseries "11.22.63" as Marina Oswald, wife of Lee Harvey Oswald, and played the lead in the 2016 Australian horror television series "Wolf Creek".', 'node_id': '380d8a91-dd0c-49a7-a206-c4daa67e0904', 'score': 1.1475938558578491}, {'text': 'Justice League is an upcoming American superhero film based on the DC Comics superhero team of the same name, distributed by Warner Bros. Pictures. It is intended to be the fifth installment in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU).', 'node_id': '38f0e55f-b0a6-4a21-8f4c-4dbf5acec412', 'score': 1.1611887216567993}, {'text': 'Barbara Niven (born February 26, 1953) is an American actress and producer, best known for her performances in Lifetime movies and television roles in "", "One Life to Live", and "Cedar Cove". Niven also had the leading role in the independent film "A Perfect Ending" (2012).', 'node_id': 'f95d2903-fda3-4ba1-b08c-bb6d30761d9f', 'score': 1.1736698150634766}, {'text': 'Aquaman is an upcoming American superhero film based on the DC Comics character of the same name, distributed by Warner Bros. Pictures. It is intended to be the sixth installment in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU). The film is being directed by James Wan, with a screenplay by Will Beall, from a story by Wan and Geoff Johns, and stars Jason Momoa, Amber Heard, Patrick Wilson, Willem Dafoe, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Temuera Morrison, Dolph Lundgren, and Nicole Kidman.', 'node_id': '1d0d3877-faf7-47a9-9e95-903eb4131d87', 'score': 1.1766021251678467}, {'text': 'The ensemble and supporting cast feature Stephanie Beatriz as Rosa Diaz, Terry Crews as Terrence "Terry" Jeffords, Melissa Fumero as Amy Santiago, Joe Lo Truglio as Charles Boyle, Chelsea Peretti as Regina "Gina" Linetti, Dirk Blocker as Michael Hitchcock and Joel McKinnon Miller as Norman "Norm" Scully.', 'node_id': '1eb4ac02-caf9-43e2-9e0a-36577d62ecd9', 'score': 1.1769089698791504}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.8338666819036007, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
