lub in Auckland New Zealand.", 'node_id': '4ee2f558-415a-4d19-9f0f-982722615f6c', 'score': 1.023921251296997}, {'text': "Gerald Reive (born 10 March 1937) is a New Zealand-based Falkland Islands athlete who represented his country at the 2010 Commonwealth Games in New Delhi, India in Lawn Bowls in the men's pairs event, alongside his playing partner George Paice. They achieved wins against Samoa and Guernsey. Reive was the flag bearer for the Falkland Islands at the closing ceremony.", 'node_id': '05b9da0f-12bd-4725-9440-185f4c448870', 'score': 1.0628845691680908}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.8818113021552563, 'vram_usage': 1.23583984375}
