uite, which had been used in Stanley Kubrick\'s "" (1968). The score also uses musical motifs, sound treatments and excerpts from Jerry Goldsmith\'s original soundtrack to "Alien" (1979).', 'node_id': 'd4a3ba6b-3e4f-4ed2-acc0-0d7e6b80025e', 'score': 1.0996228456497192}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 1.310398994013667, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
