897548198699951}, {'text': "The High Commission of Australia in London is the diplomatic mission of Australia in the United Kingdom. It is located in Australia House, a Grade II listed building. It is both Australia's first diplomatic mission and the longest continuously occupied diplomatic mission in the United Kingdom.", 'node_id': '36f424b6-453d-42f7-ab02-1bcda3101cc6', 'score': 1.12102210521698}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.691830599680543, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
