gnition after releasing three mixtapes between 2007 to 2009 and subsequently signed to Young Money Entertainment in 2009.', 'node_id': 'a89a5db3-dade-42de-85aa-ea905ed7dba4', 'score': 1.2151286602020264}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.5638143941760063, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
