['Ferdi Taygan'] {'response': "Ferdi Taygan was born on December 5, 1956, while Mahesh Bhupathi's birthdate is not provided in the context. Therefore, based on the information available, it is not possible to determine who is older. The provided context is insufficient regarding Mahesh Bhupathi's birthdate to make a comparison.", 'query': 'Who is older, Ferdi Taygan or Mahesh Bhupathi?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Mahesh Bhupathi Tennis Academy is a tennis training facility started by Indian tennis player Mahesh Bhupathi. The Academy has facilities across 9 states in India as well as in the UAE.', 'node_id': 'e7a4fdfd-8436-4223-b01f-e0b39767f70d', 'score': 10.457690238952637}, {'text': 'Mahesh Bhupathi and Leander Paes were the defending champions, but did not play together in the doubles. Bhupathi partnered with David Prinosil and lost in the third round.', 'node_id': 'b3699d4f-45fe-42a6-8d02-48c68c16d0d5', 'score': 9.510921478271484}, {'text': 'Mahesh Bhupathi and Leander Paes were the defending champions. However, they chose not to play together. Bhupathi played with Rohan Bopanna and Paes played with Radek Štěpánek', 'node_id': 'f669f5f1-08f4-4fd6-867b-0f3e9257158f', 'score': 9.402042388916016}, {'text': 'Sherwood Stewart and Ferdi Taygan were the defending champions but they competed with different partners that year, Stewart with Mark Edmondson and Taygan with Cássio Motta.', 'node_id': '5d17b898-cd85-4fab-8a15-8b3920c9204b', 'score': 8.667892456054688}, {'text': 'Peter Fleming and John McEnroe won in the final 6–4, 6–3 against Sherwood Stewart and Ferdi Taygan.', 'node_id': '39ee45c9-d8a6-4b55-842f-26da5da408a7', 'score': 8.287033081054688}, {'text': 'Anne Smith and Kevin Curren were the defending champions and won in the final 6–7, 7–6 (7–4), 7–6 (7–5) against Barbara Potter and Ferdi Taygan.', 'node_id': '6dfdad31-99ad-4c57-83df-bd1913b8e1d1', 'score': 7.905947208404541}, {'text': 'Ferdi Taygan (born December 5, 1956), is a former professional tennis player from the United States. He is of Turkish descent.', 'node_id': 'a26a20cb-3429-43ab-9604-764ac2888631', 'score': 7.7865891456604}, {'text': 'Pavel Složil and Sherwood Stewart were the defending champions, but Složil did not participate this year. Stewart partnered Ferdi Taygan, losing in the first round.', 'node_id': 'e4e8ea44-9bd3-4de7-9af4-87f6ca0defd7', 'score': 7.449204444885254}, {'text': 'Marty Riessen and Sherwood Stewart were the defending champions, but Riessen did not participate this year. Stewart partnered Ferdi Taygan, finishing runner-up.', 'node_id': '662ab7c2-1f1d-415d-a238-86499e9f01a4', 'score': 7.449204444885254}, {'text': "The Men's Doubles tournament at the 1982 French Open was held from 24 May until 6 June 1982 on the outdoor clay courts at the Stade Roland Garros in Paris, France. Sherwood Stewart and Ferdi Taygan won the title, defeating Hans Gildemeister and Belus Prajoux in the final.", 'node_id': 'ec96cdf5-d3ca-43c5-a143-423ed956085f', 'score': 6.122740745544434}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 5.637552825734019, 'vram_usage': 0.0}
