 58%|█████▊    | 292/500 [48:01<35:33, 10.26s/it] 59%|█████▊    | 293/500 [48:04<27:52,  8.08s/it]['supervisor of the royal works'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding the position of Jean Baptiste Androuet du Cerceau under the man who was King of the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth from 1573 to 1575.', 'query': 'What was the position of Jean Baptiste Androuet du Cerceau under the man who was King of the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth from 1573 to 1575?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Jacques Androuet du Cerceau, the younger (1550 – 16 September 1614), was a French architect.', 'node_id': '3c6b24de-ef55-40be-a9e7-f8b334788708', 'score': 0.7197632789611816}, {'text': 'Jean Androuet du Cerceau (c.1585–1650) was a French architect, the son of Jean Baptiste Androuet du Cerceau, the outstanding Parisian architect of his generation.', 'node_id': 'ec918763-aee2-4026-998e-a57082b43d77', 'score': 0.7967966198921204}, {'text': 'Paul Androuet du Cerceau (1623–1710), was a French goldsmith and engraver, who was active in Paris around 1610. According to "Benezit", Reynaud presumes he is the son of the architect Jean Baptiste Androuet du Cerceau, who built the Pont Neuf in Paris, but Paul is now believed to be the grandson of Jacques II Androuet du Cerceau.', 'node_id': '11aea37c-a489-4c01-b7f9-cad3ac9ff815', 'score': 0.8758863210678101}, {'text': 'Androuet du Cerceau was a family of French architects and designers active in the 16th and early 17th century.', 'node_id': '0a40b255-f435-4d4c-8f84-6ac7e047f082', 'score': 0.8868464231491089}, {'text': 'Jacques I Androuet du Cerceau, also given as Du Cerceau, DuCerceau, or Ducerceau (1510–1584) was a well-known French designer of architecture, ornament, furniture, metalwork and other decorative designs during the 16th century, and the founder of the Androuet du Cerceau family. He introduced Renaissance architecture to France with the assistance of Pierre Lescot, Philibert Delorme and Jean Bullant.', 'node_id': 'e3153415-280e-40e6-b49c-1c6aaee35c46', 'score': 0.8891384601593018}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.7777739427983761, 'vram_usage': 1.41162109375}
