California, in 1923. The company name was taken respectively from the initials of their last names—Allen and Wright.", 'node_id': 'c983615d-f24d-4315-8110-332c44e8797a', 'score': 1.121395468711853}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9747714847326279, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
