a snack bar with a \'dried milk\' covered bottom, to make the cereal with milk tradition portable. It is a cocoa flavored version of Rice Krispies. Containing a substance imitating milk chocolate, the cereal can turn milk "chocolatey."', 'node_id': '6afc13ac-f834-426e-a02f-6fc20987817f', 'score': 1.1877131462097168}, {'text': "He currently plays lawn bowls at the Papatoetoe Hunters Corner Bowling Club in Auckland He attended his second Commonwealth Games in Glasgow 2014 where he entered the men's fours with Michael Reive, Patrick Morrison, and Barry Ford.", 'node_id': '2079d533-dd0c-4941-8342-9e3e79b51ed3', 'score': 1.2310514450073242}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.523667324334383, 'vram_usage': 1.16552734375}
