petition contested by the senior women\'s national teams of the members of "Fédération Internationale de Football Association" (FIFA), the sport\'s global governing body. The competition has been held every four years since 1991, when the inaugural tournament, then called the Women\'s World Championship, was held in China.', 'node_id': '70b2117c-2fd7-42dd-967b-4f1ab955bd94', 'score': 1.0187456607818604}, {'text': "There was also a combined points competition in 2005, where the results of the men's and women's teams are added together (not including qualifiers).", 'node_id': '3e10824c-d037-4043-b7e0-b2e2df8c600a', 'score': 1.0553269386291504}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 1.0633006040006876, 'vram_usage': 1.28271484375}
