c4cb9', 'score': 0.9055821299552917}, {'text': 'Dianchi Lake (Chinese:\xa0滇池 , "Diānchí"), also known as Lake Dian and Kunming Lake (昆明湖 , "Kūnmínghú"), is a large lake located on the Yunnan-Guizhou Plateau close to Kunming, Yunnan, in southern China. Its nickname is the "Sparkling Pearl Embedded in a Highland" and it was the model for the Kunming Lake in the Summer Palace in Beijing. Its name is the source of Yunnan\'s Chinese abbreviation 滇 .', 'node_id': '89762581-29da-4519-b2df-d9cba226f4d6', 'score': 1.0709247589111328}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9320105668157339, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
