 era. Ralph Ince was the brother of John Ince and Thomas H. Ince.', 'node_id': 'd8daafff-0ad2-477a-99d5-30f6122acdf0', 'score': 1.2350091934204102}, {'text': 'He was the son of British Orientalist scholar Robert Caesar Childers; the cousin of Hugh Childers and Robert Barton; and the father of the fourth President of Ireland, Erskine Hamilton Childers.', 'node_id': '50981996-9914-4f9a-ac12-a7161f1eee23', 'score': 1.2565648555755615}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9098720978945494, 'vram_usage': 1.18896484375}
