 72%|███████▏  | 359/500 [59:41<34:18, 14.60s/it] 72%|███████▏  | 360/500 [59:45<26:49, 11.49s/it]['reigning monarch of the United Kingdom'] {'response': 'The Waterloo Vase has been used as a garden ornament in the garden of Buckingham Palace, which serves as the residence and administrative headquarters of the British monarch.', 'query': 'The Waterloo Vase has been used as a garden ornament at whose residence and administrative headquarters?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'The Waterloo Vase is a great urn, 15ft (5m) high and weighing 20 tons, fashioned from a single piece of Carrara marble. Since 1906, it has been used as a garden ornament in the garden of Buckingham Palace, London.', 'node_id': '36031fbe-d0c9-4647-b2e2-265237a19580', 'score': 0.4897798001766205}, {'text': 'The Borghese Vase is a monumental bell-shaped krater sculpted in Athens from Pentelic marble in the second half of the 1st century BC as a garden ornament for the Roman market; it is now in the Louvre Museum.', 'node_id': '29aaaa55-073b-4be3-bc9e-24421031592e', 'score': 0.9645360112190247}, {'text': 'The Medici Vase is a monumental marble bell-shaped krater sculpted in Athens in the second half of the 1st century AD as a garden ornament for the Roman market. It is now in the Uffizi Gallery in Florence.', 'node_id': '3bb74ac0-6f10-415f-9714-6297584a5c48', 'score': 1.0003690719604492}, {'text': 'A Garden ornament is an item used for garden, landscape, and park enhancement and decoration.<br>', 'node_id': '97961e00-bb0b-43d6-98a6-a391c6bc1dad', 'score': 1.0855579376220703}, {'text': 'Forbury Gardens is a public park in the town of Reading in the English county of Berkshire. The park is on the site of the outer court of Reading Abbey, which was in front of the Abbey Church. The site was formerly known as the Forbury, and one of the roads flanking the current gardens is still known as The Forbury. Fairs were held on the site three times a year until the 19th century.', 'node_id': '66f9ba67-c4e8-4587-a993-2260e02fc884', 'score': 1.14907705783844}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.632060457020998, 'vram_usage': 1.24755859375}
