5af4af6bf', 'score': 1.0379997491836548}, {'text': 'The company has 259 stores and 27 Shopping malls. The stores are divided into 64 department stores branded as Falabella, 114 home improvement stores called Sodimac and 64 supermarkets branded as Tottus. In Peru the company owns the Saga Falabella, listed in the Lima Stock Exchange.', 'node_id': '88f591ee-8580-4c6c-b7e0-959b0ce1a0c2', 'score': 1.0841748714447021}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.747383177280426, 'vram_usage': 1.30615234375}
