ode_id': '30b2115e-10dd-473b-8de3-477c84569c97', 'score': 1.2295875549316406}, {'text': 'Juan García Larrondo (born 1965) is a Spanish playwright born in El Puerto de Santa María, Cádiz Province.', 'node_id': 'f2ceb339-52c7-410e-8b9f-86ac37d71291', 'score': 1.2361114025115967}, {'text': 'Fernando Tapias Stahelin (born July 14, 1943 - † September 27, 2015) was a General (retired) of Colombian Armed Forces. He served as Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of Colombian Armed Forces for a period of four years (1998–2002) during the presidential term of president Andres Pastrana.', 'node_id': '5de917e9-89df-4068-8f5b-d8bbb6e3ea38', 'score': 1.2455092668533325}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.7018681019544601, 'vram_usage': 1.21240234375}
