75f51', 'score': 0.7416217923164368}, {'text': 'On August 13, 2014, ABC Family announced that it has picked up a fourth season of its hit original drama series "Switched at Birth", premiering on January 6, 2015. The season is produced by ABC Family, Pirates\' Cove Entertainment, and Suzy B Productions, with Paul Stupin and series creator Lizzy Weiss serving as executive producers.', 'node_id': '7c5857b7-91a7-48b3-a21c-9cef443b1856', 'score': 0.7461663484573364}], 'consistency_check': 'CONFLICT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.7705363556742668, 'vram_usage': 1.29443359375}
