).", 'node_id': '8f625151-1077-4983-bcc9-204a5ca88954', 'score': 1.1058666706085205}, {'text': 'Born in Cammarata, Province of Agrigento, Alessi entered the film industry in 1940 as an assistant director. In 1945 he started an intense career as a screenwriter, alternating between genre films and art films and collaborating with Pietro Germi, Franco Rossi, Folco Quilici and Luciano Salce, among others. He also directed two films in the 1960s.', 'node_id': '778cccb8-d7ea-413e-a8b6-de99fbee9d9c', 'score': 1.1110615730285645}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.6389931309968233, 'vram_usage': 1.22412109375}
