rtant settlement in the banner is Baiyinchagan.', 'node_id': '1adc3f19-e343-4775-b2b9-23f94e0f58d6', 'score': 1.0354517698287964}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.1386251039803028, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
