efore that had been Buena Vista Pictures Distribution since 1987.', 'node_id': '20f7650b-c36c-4a72-a5e8-946dd0e6f53b', 'score': 1.171586036682129}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.8834447301924229, 'vram_usage': 1.28271484375}
