 89%|████████▊ | 443/500 [1:13:36<13:51, 14.58s/it]['Larry Richard Drake'] {'response': 'Larry Drake, who starred in "Attack of the Gryphon," was also a voice artist in "Johnny Bravo." In "Johnny Bravo," he provided the voice for the character Pops. Larry Drake was known for his work as an actor, voice artist, and comedian, and his role in "Johnny Bravo" is one of the notable contributions to his career in animation.', 'query': 'What star of "Attack of the Gryphon" was also a voice artist in Johnny Bravo?  ', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Larry Richard Drake (February 21, 1950 – March 17, 2016) was an American actor, voice artist, and comedian best known as Benny Stulwicz in "L.A. Law", Robert G. Durant in both "Darkman" and "" and the voice of Pops in "Johnny Bravo".', 'node_id': 'c40fb233-18e6-4b07-a9e8-b7b84477b067', 'score': 0.8562085628509521}, {'text': 'Gryphon also known as "Attack of the Gryphon" is a 2007 television film directed by Andrew Prowse, starring Amber Benson, Jonathan LaPaglia, and Larry Drake. It premiered on the Sci-Fi Channel on January 27, 2007.', 'node_id': '38dfae57-8c81-444e-af6e-f5bced4b32f9', 'score': 0.9080427289009094}, {'text': 'Van Partible (born Efrem Giovanni Bravo Partible on December 13, 1971) is a Filipino-born American animator, writer and producer best known for creating the animated television series "Johnny Bravo".', 'node_id': 'b59d75b5-c9d1-43a4-b175-7a07940ac6e4', 'score': 0.9247338771820068}, {'text': '"Johnny Bravo" is an American animated television series created by Van Partible for the Cartoon Network. The series premiered July 14, 1997, and ended officially August 27, 2004. The series is a spin-off of "World Premiere Toons", also known as the "What a Cartoon! Show".', 'node_id': 'a8291632-3271-479f-a0ba-1bc41559bae4', 'score': 1.0197161436080933}, {'text': '(voiced by Alex Rocco, and, later, Hank Azaria), who runs the studio and produces the show.', 'node_id': '790646bb-6f1a-4ead-ae5b-6c3ad8292cdb', 'score': 1.077641248703003}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.0428266003727913, 'vram_usage': 1.25927734375}
