6aa4c6-af69-4820-830f-d55e0a50f606', 'score': 0.9497592449188232}, {'text': 'The episode also earned 3 other Emmy nominations as well as and DGA – Drama Series nominations.', 'node_id': '1fc640b9-6c46-4b86-a2ee-9749cf6c19f7', 'score': 0.95238196849823}, {'text': 'The 61st Golden Globe Awards, honoring the best in film and television for 2003, were held on January 25, 2004 at the Beverly Hilton Hotel in Beverly Hills, California.', 'node_id': '22ca4e30-f86c-40fe-963a-c153e32dca97', 'score': 0.984387218952179}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.7728918064385653, 'vram_usage': 1.29443359375}
