 90%|█████████ | 452/500 [1:15:01<09:00, 11.26s/it]['Graduados'] {'response': 'The Argentine telenovela broadcast by Telefe from March 12 to December 19, 2012, that starred Isabel Macedo as Jimena Benitez is "Graduados." In this telenovela, Patricia Longo, also known as Jimena Benitez, is portrayed by Isabel Macedo, who plays the character both as an adult and in flashbacks as a teenager. "Graduados" is notable for its engaging storyline and character development, contributing to its popularity during its airing.', 'query': 'Which Argentine telenovela broadcast by Telefe from March 12 to December 19, 2012 starred Isabel Macedo as Jimena Benitez?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'Patricia Longo, also known as Jimena Benìtez, is a fictional character in the 2012 Argentine telenovela "Graduados". She is played by Isabel Macedo, both as an adult and, in flashbacks, as a teenager.', 'node_id': 'e08b9146-91f4-4bfc-b576-94d28c825691', 'score': 0.8631342053413391}, {'text': 'Montecristo: Un Amor, Una Venganza (Monte Cristo: Love and Revenge) is an Argentine telenovela which premiered April 25, 2006 on Telefe. Loosely based on the 1844 Alexandre Dumas novel, "The Count of Monte Cristo", "Montecristo" is Telefe\'s most popular novela and was called "the hottest telenovela in Argentina" by "Variety" in 2007.', 'node_id': '6b96b489-ee33-474d-9835-905b5c98b83d', 'score': 0.9201281666755676}, {'text': "Niní was an Argentine children's telenovela broadcast on Telefe from 2009 onwards, starring Florencia Bertotti and Federico Amador, written by Gabriela Fiore and Jorge Chernov. It was produced by Bertotti and her former husband, TV host Guido Kaczka, in conjunction with Endemol. It also starred Maida Andrenacci and Paula Morales as the main antagonist.", 'node_id': 'b82f9892-dc00-4237-b1ab-2e01923a5627', 'score': 0.9427827596664429}, {'text': 'The original stars were Florencia Peña and Nicolás Cabré, who played Giselle López and Cristian "Chiqui" Flores. Peña resigned after the genre shift, as the shift caused her character to lose importance, which, compiled with Peña\'s general dissatisfaction with the show, saw Romina Gaetani\'s and Isabel Macedo\'s characters (Laura Posse/Mía Alberdi and Margarita "Marga" Molinari respectively) gain superior notability in contrast to her own.', 'node_id': '33046121-d85d-4eeb-a279-af32b31bf869', 'score': 0.964142382144928}, {'text': 'Verano del \'98 ("Endless Summer") is an Argentine telenovela, produced by Cris Morena. It was broadcast on Telefe television in the period January 12, 1998 – November 17, 2000. The telenovela had three seasons, and changed its cast many times. Cris Morena also composed songs for "Verano del \'98" soundtrack.', 'node_id': 'c1f1c07c-9a49-4e15-af14-9dc0421a4ad7', 'score': 1.098604679107666}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.4761025179177523, 'vram_usage': 1.32958984375}
