ht, Sam Elliott, Anna Paquin, A.J. Buckley, Steve Zahn, Jeffrey Wright, and Frances McDormand.', 'node_id': '3c83de16-9cd1-48c0-81a2-ef13b8f768b9', 'score': 0.8731560707092285}, {'text': '(voiced by Alex Rocco, and, later, Hank Azaria), who runs the studio and produces the show.', 'node_id': '790646bb-6f1a-4ead-ae5b-6c3ad8292cdb', 'score': 0.9532620310783386}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 0.9913046900182962, 'vram_usage': 1.27099609375}
