ties after the match was ended 1–1 after the regular and extra time.", 'node_id': 'a77c0653-6288-4940-b890-9c895d49bc2d', 'score': 1.2424027919769287}, {'text': 'Den Za Nas (in Macedonian: Ден за нас ) is the title of the fourth Macedonian language album by the Macedonian superstar Toše Proeski released in 2004. It is a 2-CD set which contains all of the songs performed on the National final in order to select a song for the Eurovision Song Contest 2004 with which Proeski would represent Macedonia in the contest. The winning song was "Life" which qualified for the final and finished on the 14th place in the final.', 'node_id': 'e704abff-3c6f-4434-97a1-7a5777d0c7cc', 'score': 1.2999229431152344}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'NEUTRAL'}, 'latency': 1.1857583951205015, 'vram_usage': 1.18896484375}
