ludes a CD and a DVD, showing their concert in Buffalo, New York from July 4, 2004. The concert included performances of all their major hits, including "Iris", "Name", and "Slide". There are nineteen (19) songs on the DVD total, plus a studio version of their Supertramp cover, "Give A Little Bit" on the CD.', 'node_id': 'c83c20c5-187d-4ae9-ba42-7505bc3a5a04', 'score': 0.9510782957077026}, {'text': 'The Goo Goo Dolls have had 19 top ten singles on various charts, and have sold more than 12 million albums worldwide.', 'node_id': '44d3dc6e-0f86-417e-9530-9b8458f2e8fb', 'score': 0.9703335762023926}], 'consistency_check': 'CONSISTENT', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'NEUTRAL', 'response': 'ENTAILMENT'}, 'latency': 0.9351936541497707, 'vram_usage': 1.17724609375}
