te 2 seasons with relative success, the series folded at the end of the 1996 season, again leaving Franchitti without a drive.', 'node_id': '1170da43-2949-4860-bc13-ea7fcac3e00e', 'score': 0.9741809368133545}, {'text': 'Mercedes placed Franchitti in CART in 1997 with the Hogan Racing team.', 'node_id': '1232b95c-fe1c-426d-a43f-adae628dd766', 'score': 1.0438988208770752}, {'text': 'Eduardo Portela Marín (born 1934 in Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain) is a Spanish former basketball player, former basketball coach, and basketball executive. He is the former head of the ACB, the governing body of the top-tier level Spanish professional club basketball league, and the former head of ULEB, the Union of European Leagues of Basketball.', 'node_id': 'da81df93-77c1-4ac0-baeb-b84834ba0073', 'score': 1.1626077890396118}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'ENTAILMENT', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.9813204072415829, 'vram_usage': 1.38818359375}
