 99%|█████████▉| 495/500 [1:21:15<01:09, 13.93s/it]['4,613'] {'response': 'The provided context is insufficient regarding the number of restaurants in the quick service restaurant chain that Ron Joyce helped found.', 'query': 'How many restaurants comprise the quick service restaurant chain that Ron Joyce helped found?', 'retrieved_context': [{'text': 'A fast food restaurant, also known as a quick service restaurant (QSR) within the industry, is a specific type of restaurant that serves fast food cuisine and has minimal table service. The food served in fast food restaurants is typically part of a "meat-sweet diet", offered from a limited menu, cooked in bulk in advance and kept hot, finished and packaged to order, and usually available for take away, though seating may be provided. Fast food restaurants are typically part of a restaurant chain or franchise operation that provisions standardized ingredients and/or partially prepared foods and supplies to each restaurant through controlled supply channels.', 'node_id': '8b4985e6-f763-4976-a3f6-9ad3de05124d', 'score': 0.9113047122955322}, {'text': 'VIP\'s, alternatively written Vip\'s, is a defunct restaurant chain in the Western United States that operated from 1968 until the late 1980s, based in Salem, Oregon. With more than 50 locations, it was once the largest restaurant chain based in Oregon. It was a Denny\'s-style restaurant, a type that was commonly known at that time as a "coffee shop" but is now more commonly known as a casual dining restaurant. Most restaurants were located near freeways and were open 24 hours.', 'node_id': '1139f850-3de0-43ab-85da-6c0f0e7efd71', 'score': 1.0869426727294922}, {'text': 'Most restaurants were located near freeways and were open 24 hours. At its peak, the chain had locations in five states: Oregon, Washington, Idaho, Nevada and northern California.', 'node_id': 'e765984a-40d2-4760-85a3-b3a47ee6919d', 'score': 1.114269733428955}, {'text': 'Toddle House was a national quick service restaurant chain in the United States, which specialized in breakfast but was open 24/7. Much of their business was takeout.', 'node_id': '1f3a1cfa-c97d-402f-928e-0c02d471e0b4', 'score': 1.11525559425354}, {'text': 'The Works is a Canadian restaurant chain based in Ottawa, Ontario. The restaurant chain started by Brad Fennema in Ottawa in 2001, has grown to 27 locations across southern Ontario.', 'node_id': 'c0d2df0b-8bb6-41ab-a235-1bcb35afd0f2', 'score': 1.1364386081695557}], 'consistency_check': 'MISSING', 'entailment_check': {'query': 'CONTRADICTION', 'response': 'CONTRADICTION'}, 'latency': 0.9058047663420439, 'vram_usage': 1.20068359375}
